  "processing": [
    "read_lattice: whole 128x128 fixed canvas",
    "clean_edge: magenta removal",
    "lock_palette: same 26-color repository master palette",
    "joint landmark registration: fixed 18px torso, neutral leg section32; calf/boot contact correction only below fixed knees",
    "eight separately generated hair outlines: one shared x-grid factor0.9 and upper-hair-only row repairs -1..2, face rows excluded",
    "face-only identity restoration from the approved v2 normalization of hero_side, rectangle [64,45,82,60]; no full-head master replacement",
    "finish_frames.py pixel: scale .25 from a separate neutral calibration still, 128x128 canvas, no added outline or contrast/saturation lift",
    "after pixel cleanup, preserve each frame own generated hair and master facial patch, never a shared head",
    "torso registration on chest band [0.46,0.62]",
    "sheet_qc.py --cycle walk --strict for explicitly grounded run",
    "gait_loop.py: same eight drawings repeated three times for minimum-length analysis; selected [0,8)",
    "build_animation_clips.py --strict, ticks5 at60Hz"
  ],
  "anatomyNote": "Neutral anatomy90/head40/leg32 from approved v2. Bbox height changes to89 on load and92 on push because the body bobs while a support sole remains109. No full-frame per-frame bbox scaling.",
  "anchorNote": "Runtime anchor(64,109) refers to last occupied ground row. The row lower edge is110; finish tool uses edge anchor(64,110).",
